NPEs were not particularly high. For instance, the reproduction rate
of an NPE in “Bears-46”, detected with an extended time budget,
was below 20% for both NpeTest and EvoSuite . These experimental results indicate that the correlation between longer testing time
and NPE detection is insignificant, highlighting the need for NPEguided approaches to effectively detect NPEs.



